  "knownDiffs": "weather and weather-missing (mobile, both photo modes): 124 and 91 pixels of glyph antialiasing in the '다른 조합 1/n' line and two captions. The same pairs captured from the WO-08b build differ by the same pixels, and the React captures are byte-identical between the WO-08b and WO-08c builds, so this predates WO-08c (not caused by the tile move). Cause not identified. Desktop weather: 86 pixels of glyph antialiasing in the '다른 조합 1/n' number. On the WO-08b build the React desktop weather card was 1px taller than vanilla (888x526 vs 888x525); with React tiles it is the same size as vanilla.",
